  "ruleText": "Rev 1612.02 Mailing Address. All forms, unless specified otherwise, shall be mailed to:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\n109 Pleasant Street\n\nPO Box 637\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0637\n\nSource. #6336, eff 9-24-96; ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1611.02); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
